1. MODEL & SERVICE CREATION
- Course Model: Defined Course interface in src/app/models/course.model.ts
- CourseService (npx ng g s services/course):
  * Root provided singleton (@Injectable({ providedIn: 'root' }))
  * Manages courses array with getCourses(), getCourseById(id), addCourse(course)
- EnrollmentService (npx ng g s services/enrollment):
  * Demonstrates Service-to-Service Dependency Injection
  * Injects CourseService into constructor to resolve course IDs to full Course objects
  * Methods: enroll(id), unenroll(id), isEnrolled(id), getEnrolledCourses()

2. SINGLETON SERVICE DEMONSTRATION
- CourseListComponent & HomeComponent both inject root CourseService
- Created CourseSummaryWidgetComponent (npx ng g c components/course-summary-widget)
  * Injects CourseService to read live courses count
  * Renders summary widget confirming shared state across components

3. HIERARCHICAL DI & COMPONENT-LEVEL PROVIDERS
- Created NotificationService & NotificationComponent (npx ng g c components/notification)
- Provided NotificationService at component level using:
  providers: [NotificationService] in @Component decorator
- Included code comments explaining how component-level providers instantiate a new, 
  isolated service instance scoped specifically to that component instance tree.
- StudentProfileComponent injects EnrollmentService to show live enrolled course list

